   "extras": {
    "edit_note": "Placeholder \u9b5a\u5e02\u5834 on a quay 1.5 m over the water (the 320 x 136 m reserve, S15), laid out in WORLD numbers round what the generators own, read at build time: the land (island_reshape MARKET_QUAY_S z 842 / 848, the plain quay z 808 east of x 525, MARKET_LANDING 0.5 m lower, the strip's 4.1 m, LINK_CORRIDOR) and the ROADS (island_site_access: the 2 + 2 truck ramp, J, the one-way ring, K, the through link): keep paving, walls and props off their bands. Origin = island_plan's reserve centre on the yard; the quay at -Y. Nothing west of x 288 (the coast road's dike face). The mesh is the collider; every stair is real steps with a HULL_stair_ slide over its nosings; the ways out of the sea are the slipway, the landing stairs, the pontoon's steps and the sea-wall stair (the yellow ladders are visual only). Roofs stay <= 12.5 m over the yard."
   },
